{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 46","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> but greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72d85c6959aaabfff6e0104544ff25c1445f3f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" />, the expression\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/f/b7fc3ec32debd4a7ee4b2751cd4f6620f4637ea7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2 - 2x + 2}{2x - 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"93\" height=\"39\" />\nhas:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/9/8c9d500e164f89f1fddacb5e4db162241fabd862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{no maximum or minimum value}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{a minimum value of }{+1}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{a maximum value of }{+1}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{a minimum value of }{-1}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{a maximum value of }{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"267\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/f/b7fc3ec32debd4a7ee4b2751cd4f6620f4637ea7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2 - 2x + 2}{2x - 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"93\" height=\"39\" />, we can further factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/f/96f2250caa0821bf576be8960fc75fb71a7f3316.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2 - 2x + 2}{2(x - 1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"93\" height=\"43\" /> and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/b/a6baa915345808b9a7ed96804d474c658048f980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(x-1)^{2}+1}{2(x - 1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"100\" height=\"45\" /> and finally <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/f/02fe075f3c5360fb968c5bd3423b01eec9839590.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x-1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2x-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"121\" height=\"37\" />. Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6881c5aa54ff16ee44e9c045a7eb13c5dc303d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM-GM$\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" />, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/9/a9980ea47370335a3a685303466024a3c6c81999.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x-1}{2}=\\frac{1}{2x-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"127\" height=\"40\" />. From there, we can get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/4/8c42de46c9f0d43ea322c61e0490ec962ae12db5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2=2 \\cdot (x-1)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>From there, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Substituting both of them in, you get that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then the value is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. If you plug in the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, you get the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e41e3cd48cee2c6866cfbb4386a8e99d3482f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Solution by: the_referee\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">Problem 45</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 47\">Problem 47</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">